<span class="line"><span style="color:#98C379;">        &quot;rejected&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">: </span><span style="color:#98C379;">&quot;There are many programming languages. Some popular ones include various languages like Python and others.&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">,</span></span>
