<span class="line"><span style="color:#98C379;">        &quot;rejected&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">: </span><span style="color:#98C379;">&quot;World War II was a major global conflict. It involved many countries. The war ended in the mid-1940s, specifically in 1945.&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">,</span></span>
