<span class="line"><span style="color:#98C379;">        &quot;preferred&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">: </span><span style="color:#98C379;">&quot;Machine learning is a field where algorithms learn patterns from data to make predictions without being explicitly programmed.&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">,</span></span>
